{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268za6SNfRSF1792852727.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山頂光影匯演項目引起爭議，旅遊事務專員聯同旅發局，與立法會議員陳家珮等到場視察相關裝置。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PEAK-1900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026negpQ5wVTZ1792852753.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>陳家珮早前去信文體旅局，指收到眾多反對意見，又認為裝置破壞山體，要求當局考慮終止項目。旅遊事務專員陳慧欣與陳家珮及中西區議員楊哲安，視察盧吉道及夏力道，向他們講解並解釋項目理念，又指一直有諮詢樹藝師意見，及採取適當保護措施。</p><p></p><p>局方指，會繼續安排不同議員到山頂視察，並聽取更多意見，務求早日完善項目。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T15:22:54.457447+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:38:19.456985+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:26.639290+00:00","content_hash":"dbc88dfb00f7d4e39778436b39e257a1e2857e952c13e5d1ac265652b7417260","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}